        "description": "Deletes the list. The contacts themselves stay in the workspace and in every other list they belong to; custom columns and their cell values go with the list. A second delete of the same id answers 404 LIST_NOT_FOUND.\n\nErrors:\n- `404` `LIST_NOT_FOUND` — No list with that id is visible to the token owner.\n- `422` `VALIDATION_FAILED` — listId is not a 24-hex id.\n- `429` `RATE_LIMITED` — The lists rate bucket is exhausted.\n\nRequires one of the following token scopes: lists."
      }
    },
    "/business/lists/save-to-list": {
