        "description": "The connected sending accounts for one channel. `channel=email` lists the mailboxes the token owner owns or has shared with them: `id` is the email address (use it as a campaign sender), `provider` is gmail, outlook or smtp, and needsReauthAt/needsReauthReason are set when the provider invalidated the connection. `channel=linkedin` lists the owner's LinkedIn seats: `id` is the LinkedIn account id accepted by `linkedin_sender_account_ids`, `type` is the LinkedIn plan (classic or a premium variant). Available to any valid key (no scope needed). Rate limit: 120 requests per minute, 10000 per day.\n\nErrors:\n- `422` `VALIDATION_FAILED` — `channel` is missing (it is required) or is not email or linkedin.\n- `429` `RATE_LIMITED` — Per-user quota for this endpoint family exceeded (120 per minute, 10000 per day); retry after the Retry-After / RateLimit-Reset seconds."
