                        "description": "NAICS entries whose `value` is the code, not the title (`naicsCodes[].code` in GET /companies/filter-options, e.g. 513210 for Software Publishers; 2- to 6-digit codes are all accepted, a shorter code being the broader sector). An off-list value is not rejected by this API: the search comes back empty (or fails upstream) with no error naming the field, so check the value against the list first. Include values are OR-joined (provider `anyOf`) and every exclude value is removed (`noneOf`); this filter ANDs with the others."
                      },
                      "headquartersCountryCode": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
