                                "type": "boolean"
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "array",
                                "items": {
                                  "type": "string"
                                }
                              }
                            ],
                            "description": "Free text, matched as an EXACT term and NOT as a range: the stored start date of the current job, YYYY-MM or YYYY-MM-DD exactly as stored (most profiles store YYYY-MM), so 2023-05-01 does not match a profile stored as 2023-05. A string, or an array of dates that are OR-joined."
